  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">hasDistinctPart</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DP(x, y) ≡ PP(x, y) ∧ ∃φ[φ(x) ↔ ¬φ(y)]</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The superproperty of all object property relations between an entity and one of its proper parts that belongs to different taxonomical branch.</rdfs:comment>
