  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semiotic relation that connects a recognised semiotic object to a mathematical model in a cognition process.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:altLabel xml:lang="en">hasMathematicalModel</core:altLabel>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasModel</core:prefLabel>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">A semiotic relation that connects a recognised semiotic object to a mathematical model in a cognition process.</elucidation>
  <note xml:lang="en">This relation can e.g. be used to relate a computation to the mathematical model that is evaluated by the computation.

Another use is to relate a dataset to the mathematical model used to calculate the dataset.</note>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

