  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The relation connecting a description with its property parts. Description and parts are signs for the same entity</rdfs:comment>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">The relation connecting a description with its property parts. Description and parts are signs for the same entity</elucidation>
  <note xml:lang="en">This relation is used to specify the detailed information that make up the overall description for an entity. A description can be used to summarize in one single entiity several properties relaterd to the same referent.</note>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

