  <EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Short enlightening explanation aimed to facilitate the user in drawing the connection (interpretation) between a OWL entity and the real world object(s) for which it stands.</EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
