  <elucidation xml:lang="en">For a substance in a mixture, the absolute activity of the pure substance at the same temperature but at standard pressure.</elucidation>
  <qudtReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/StandardAbsoluteActivity</qudtReference>
