  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A scripting language developed specifically for an application, so that it's usage and interpretation is limited in this context.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Scripting file for the execution of modelling software such as LAMMPS, OpenFOAM, or for general purpose platforms such as MATLAB or Mathematica.</core:example>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ApplicationSpecificScript</core:prefLabel>
  <elucidation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A scripting language developed specifically for an application, so that it's usage and interpretation is limited in this context.</elucidation>
</owl:Class>

