  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">IterativeTask</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative workflow which is a task of a larger workflow.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:example xml:lang="en">A Jacobi method, involving the iterative multiplication between a matrix A and a vector x, which is part of larger workflow for the solution of a partial differential equation using finite differences.</core:example>
