  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ElementaryCharge</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The DBpedia definition (http://dbpedia.org/page/Elementary_charge) is outdated as May 20, 2019. It is now an exact quantity.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The magnitude of the electric charge carried by a single electron. It defines the base unit Ampere in the SI system.</rdfs:comment>
