  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#EMMO_846b637b_7b12_47a1_9430_0274b2f588ac"/>
  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">SubProcess</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process which is a spatial part of another process.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:example xml:lang="en">Breathing is a subprocess of living for a human being.</core:example>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">SubProcess</core:prefLabel>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">A process which is a spatial part of another process.</elucidation>
  <note xml:lang="en">In the EMMO the relation of participation to a process falls under mereotopology.

Since topological connection means causality, then the only way for a real world object to participate to a process is to be a part of it.</note>
</owl:Class>

