  </owl:equivalentClass>
  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Replica</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An icon that not only resembles the object, but also can express some of the object's functions.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:example xml:lang="en">A small scale replica of a plane tested in a wind gallery shares the same functionality in terms of aerodynamic behaviour of the bigger one.</core:example>
  <core:example xml:lang="en">Pinocchio is a functional icon of a boy since it imitates the external behaviour without having the internal biological structure of a human being (it is made of magic wood...).</core:example>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Replica</core:prefLabel>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">An icon that not only resembles the object, but also can express some of the object's functions.</elucidation>
</owl:Class>

