  <elucidation xml:lang="en">in a given medium, average distance that particles of a specified type travel between successive interactions of a specified type.</elucidation>
  <iupacReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.M03778</iupacReference>
  <qudtReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MeanFreePath</qudtReference>
