  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">LinearIonization</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Differential quotient of q with respect to l, where q is the average total charge of all positive ions produced by an ionizing charged particle over a path l, divided by the elementary charge.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">LinearIonization</core:prefLabel>
