  <OWLRL2DLAxioms rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">EquivalentTo: Uncoded or Coded</OWLRL2DLAxioms>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">A 'Sign' that stands for an 'Object' through convention, norm or habit, without any resemblance to it.</elucidation>
  <note xml:lang="en">In Peirce semiotics this kind of sign category is called symbol. However, since symbol is also used in formal languages, the name is changed in conventional.</note>
</owl:Class>

