  <note xml:lang="en">An icon that focus on WHERE/WHEN the object is, in the sense of spatial or temporal shape.</note>
  <note xml:lang="en">The subclass of icon inspired by Peirceian category a) the image, which depends on a simple quality (e.g. picture).</note>
</owl:Class>

