  <EMMO_8189b42e_0995_423a_a26c_51168b27c3cf rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.3732417</EMMO_8189b42e_0995_423a_a26c_51168b27c3cf>
  <EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.0</EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">An obsolete unit of mass; the Troy Pound has been defined as exactly 5760 grains, or 0.3732417216 kg. A Troy Ounce is 1/12th of a Troy Pound.

