<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#MetrePerSecond">
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_1273eb34_de48_43a9_925f_104110469dd2"/>
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_4f5c7c54_1c63_4d17_b12b_ea0792c2b187"/>
  <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/units/coherentsiunits-abox#"/>
  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">MetrePerSecond</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Metre per second is an SI derived unit of both speed (scalar) and velocity (vector quantity which specifies both magnitude and a specific direction), defined by distance in metres divided by time in seconds.
The official SI symbolic abbreviation is mu00b7s-1, or equivalently either m/s.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">MetrePerSecond</core:prefLabel>
  <sche:unitCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MTS</sche:unitCode>
  <EMMO_8189b42e_0995_423a_a26c_51168b27c3cf rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">1.0</EMMO_8189b42e_0995_423a_a26c_51168b27c3cf>
  <EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.0</EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">Metre per second is an SI derived unit of both speed (scalar) and velocity (vector quantity which specifies both magnitude and a specific direction), defined by distance in metres divided by time in seconds.
The official SI symbolic abbreviation is mu00b7s-1, or equivalently either m/s.

-- QUDT</elucidation>
  <omReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/metrePerSecond-Time</omReference>
  <qudtReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M-PER-SEC</qudtReference>
  <ucumCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">m.s-1</ucumCode>
  <unitSymbol rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">m/s</unitSymbol>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

