  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The hertz (symbol Hz) is the SI unit of frequency defined as the number of cycles per second of a periodic phenomenon. A GigaHertz is 10⁹ hz.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
  <core:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GigaHertz</core:prefLabel>
