  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">'BTU per Square Foot Second Degree Fahrenheit' is an Imperial unit for 'Coefficient Of Heat Transfer' expressed as Btu/(ft²-s-degF).

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
