  <EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.0</EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">The `fermi`, or `femtometer` (other spelling femtometre, symbol fm) is an SI unit of length equal to 10⁻¹⁵ metre. This distance is often encountered in nuclear physics as a characteristic of this scale. The symbol for the fermi is also fm.

