  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">KiloPascal</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Kilopascal is a unit of pressure. 1 kPa is approximately the pressure exerted by a 10-g mass resting on a 1-cm2 area. 101.3 kPa = 1 atm. There are 1,000 pascals in 1 kilopascal.

