<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#TeraByte">
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_15d62b55_38ea_4aec_b7c4_25db1a2e5a01"/>
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_3a204900_2b33_47d1_b444_815cc4c8cffa"/>
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_8246541a_f1f6_4d03_8bd7_fc6b76d17375"/>
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_c6d4a5e0_7e95_44df_a6db_84ee0a8bbc8e"/>
  <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/units/unclassifiedunits-abox#"/>
  <EMMO_d4e0a0ab_2f67_4f87_a0db_b544e6dceed4 rdf:resource="#Byte"/>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TeraByte</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The terabyte is a multiple of the unit byte for digital information. The prefix tera means 10¹² in the International System of Units (SI), and therefore 1 terabyte is 1000000000000bytes, or 1 trillion bytes, or 1000 gigabytes. 1 terabyte in binary prefixes is 0.9095 tebibytes, or 931.32 gibibytes. The unit symbol for the terabyte is TB or TByte, but not Tb (lower case b) which refers to terabit.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
  <core:altLabel xml:lang="en">TeraByte</core:altLabel>
  <core:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TeraByte</core:prefLabel>
  <EMMO_8189b42e_0995_423a_a26c_51168b27c3cf rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">5545177000000.0</EMMO_8189b42e_0995_423a_a26c_51168b27c3cf>
  <EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.0</EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">The terabyte is a multiple of the unit byte for digital information. The prefix tera means 10¹² in the International System of Units (SI), and therefore 1 terabyte is 1000000000000bytes, or 1 trillion bytes, or 1000 gigabytes. 1 terabyte in binary prefixes is 0.9095 tebibytes, or 931.32 gibibytes. The unit symbol for the terabyte is TB or TByte, but not Tb (lower case b) which refers to terabit.

-- QUDT</elucidation>
  <qudtReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/TeraBYTE</qudtReference>
  <ucumCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TBy</ucumCode>
  <unitSymbol rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TB</unitSymbol>
  <wikipediaReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terabyte?oldid=494671550</wikipediaReference>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#CentiMetre">
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_8246541a_f1f6_4d03_8bd7_fc6b76d17375"/>
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#EMMO_b3600e73_3e05_479d_9714_c041c3acf5cc"/>
