  <EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.0</EMMO_d088a3cb_d3e3_4eb2_9897_00aef0cb00cd>
  <elucidation xml:lang="en">The henry per meter (symbolized H/m) is the unit of magnetic permeability in the International System of Units ( SI ). Reduced to base units in SI, 1 H/m is the equivalent of one kilogram meter per square second per square ampere.

