  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Oz_Per_Day</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">traditional unit of the mass avoirdupois ounce according to the avoirdupois system of units divided by the unit for time day

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
