  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">JouleSecond</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The joule-second is a unit equal to a joule multiplied by a second, used to measure action or angular momentum. The joule-second is the unit used for Planck's constant.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
