  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gilbert</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The fundamental unit of magnetomotive force (mmf) in electromagnetic units is called a Gilbert. It is the mmf which will produce a magnetic field strength of one Gauss (Maxwell per Square Centimeter) in a path one centimeter long.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
